These enemies have a chance to perform [[Critical Hit]]s, which is indicated by producing a burst of yellow stars with a unique sound effect. Critical Hits inflict 2x damage on all targets and ignore the [[Metal]] ability.

==Trivia==
*If an enemy with Critical Hits and [[Wave Attack]]s hits a [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] Cat with a Critical Wave, the next attack from any enemy that hits that Cat will show the Critical Hit's visual effect, but not do double damage. This is most likely a bug. 
